error 31..34: Cannot assign to Int32 from Float64
error 53..54: Cannot assign to Float64 from Int32
error 71..72: Cannot assign to Int64 from Int32
error 113..118: Cannot assign to String from Int32
error 169..170: Cannot assign to fn (Int32): Int32 from Int32

